## `Compat/` — Compatibility Layer

`Compat/` holds a set of stub XML files that verbatim-import legacy AGE `.g` source from
`pams/geometry/` for modules that have not been converted to native AGML.  Examples include
`tpcegeo.xml` (the original GEANT3 TPC module), `richgeo.xml`, `gembgeo.xml`, and
`pixlgeo.xml`.  A companion `tpcegeo3.xml` does the same for the Yuri Fisyak TPC model.

These files exist purely so the AGML loader can manage legacy modules through the same
`<Construct>` dispatch mechanism as fully-ported modules.

